A small Node/Express backend for the FitCoach marketing site, with real account registration, login, and subscription plan management backed by a SQLite database.
Ring position -7

What the app stores
Gym membership
Fitness instructions
Equipment
Member subscription
Pricing 
Fitness plans 
Exercise
Workout log 
Progress metric
Notifications
Actions
User / Auth
•	Register (create account)
•	Log in / log out
•	View own profile
•	Edit profile (name, email, password, goals, fitness level, equipment, schedule)
•	Delete account
•	(Admin) search/filter users by plan, signup date, activity
WorkoutPlan
•	View current plan
•	Generate/create a new plan (based on profile inputs)
•	Edit/regenerate plan (change goal, adjust difficulty)
•	Deactivate/archive an old plan
•	View plan history (past plans)
Exercise
•	View/browse exercise library
•	Search exercises (by name)
•	Filter exercises (by muscle group, equipment needed, difficulty)
•	(Admin/coach) create, edit, delete exercise entries
PlanExercise
•	View exercises within a specific plan/day
•	Reorder exercises in a plan
•	Edit target sets/reps/weight for an exercise in a plan
•	Remove an exercise from a plan
WorkoutLog
•	Log a completed workout (create)
•	Mark a workout/session as complete
•	Edit a past log entry (correct a mistake)
•	Delete a log entry
•	View workout history
•	Filter logs by date range or exercise
ProgressMetric
•	Add a new metric entry (weight, body fat %, resting heart rate, etc.)
•	Edit an entry
•	Delete an entry
•	View trend over time (filter by date range, metric type)
CoachingMessage
•	Send a message/question (optionally with video/photo attachment)
•	View message thread
•	(Coach) reply to a message
•	Mark a message as read
•	(Coach) filter/search messages by client or status (answered/unanswered)
Coach
•	(Admin) create/promote a coach
•	(Admin) deactivate a coach
•	View list of assigned clients
•	View a specific client's history (with permission)
Challenge
•	View active/upcoming challenges
•	Join a challenge
•	Leave a challenge
•	Log progress toward a challenge
•	View leaderboard
•	(Admin) create, edit, end a challenge
SubscriptionPlan
•	View available plans
•	Compare plans (implicitly a view/filter)
•	(Admin) create/edit/retire a plan tier
Payment
•	Subscribe (create a payment + update user plan)
•	Cancel subscription
•	View billing history
•	(Admin) filter payments by status, date, user
•	(Admin) issue a refund
Partner
•	(Admin) create a partner account + issue API key
•	(Admin) revoke/regenerate API key
•	(Partner) verify a member's subscription status
•	(Admin) view partner usage/activity
Notification
•	View notifications
•	Mark as read
•	Mark all as read
•	Delete a notification
•	(System) create a notification (triggered by other actions, not user-initiated
